      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASCEND GERANIUM (5) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind No Stop Signs (34.68) in a Grade 4/5. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Sure to be about the mark. FAST REPLY (8) drifted back settling but did best work late to finish 5th at this track over 600m (35.40). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Cannot be taken lightly. QUINLEE BALE (2) has a strong winning strike-rate over this journey with two wins and a placing from six tries. Hit the frame latest (30.01) when third at Sandown in a Grade 4. Can feature with the right run. MR. FIELD (7) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
